            },
            "description": {
              "value": "The forms you take on defy belief\u2014chimerical sights of twisted antlers or acidic drool. If your next action is to cast wild shape, you can change the damage type of a single unarmed attack granted by the wild shape form to one of the following: acid, bludgeoning, cold, electricity, fire, poison, piercing, or slashing.\n\nThe chosen attack gains the appropriate trait."
